# Add password login

## Why
The `auth` capability does not yet exist.

-- openspec/changes/001-add-password-login/specs/auth/spec.yaml --
capability: auth
deltas:
  - op: ADDED
    requirement:
      name: Password login
      text: The system SHALL allow a registered user to authenticate with a username and password.
      scenarios:
        - name: Successful login with correct password
          given:
            - a registered user with a known password
          when:
            - the user submits the correct username and password
          then:
            - the system SHALL grant an authenticated session

